## Data Model - spike S1-S8 (see tests/dmSpike-v0.1.x/spike-tests.md for what each test checks and what to report).
## Read-only diagnostics, except the explicit "PATCH" button of S4 (browser only), which writes the description back unchanged.
## Velocity 1.4 dialect (guide 3.1.9): no map literals, one statement per line, no backslashes in string literals.
## An exception stops the render: the error text of the page IS the finding (report it), then run the tests one by one.
## Times: Long arithmetic does not compute on 2512, so start and end stamps (ms) are printed.
<style>
  .dms { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; }
  .dms h4 { margin: 12px 0 6px 0; }
  .dms table { border-collapse: collapse; margin: 6px 0; }
  .dms td, .dms th { border: 1px solid rgb(187,187,187); padding: 2px 6px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  .dms th { background: rgb(238,238,238); }
  .dms .ok { color: rgb(26,127,55); font-weight: bold; }
  .dms .ko { color: rgb(198,40,40); font-weight: bold; }
  .dms pre { background: rgb(246,246,246); padding: 4px; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-all; max-height: 400px; overflow: auto; }
  .dms button { margin: 2px 6px 2px 0; }
</style>

